WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:34.030
The battlefield centered around Angel Halo...

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:36.030
...has expanded greatly.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:42.060
Amidst it, Üso was able to break through Fuala Griffon's resistance.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:46.930
However, he was only able to do so because of Marbet's pregnancy.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:52.360
This, the thing that controlled so much of this battlefield,

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:55.060
was something men knew nothing about.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.230
FADING LIFE, BLOOMING LIFE

00:01:57.230 --> 00:02:01.100
"Fading Life, Blooming Life".
FADING LIFE, BLOOMING LIFE

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.960
We need to clear a route to Earth!

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:28.960
Thanks to Tassilo's withdrawal from the battle line,

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.760
the League Militaire was able to move their main forces up!

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:35.630
That's why we need to regroup two or three squadrons.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.460
Then do so, at once! That's an order!

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.730
When you see Angel Halo, you'll understand.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.860
We can land it on Earth.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.960
No changes, from alpha waves to theta waves.

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:55.560
Composite readings of all waves show a doubling from 100 gigahertz.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.430
Ring five has been connected.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.060
Check all psycho variables.

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:02.030
You, who fight and spill blood.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:07.900
Do not throw your bodies into the midst of that fear and despair.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:13.460
If you do, your bodies will burn up, and you will gain nothing.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:14.800
My only wish is for the Earth to restart...

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:17.360
Forget your fleeting hatred and anger.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.230
...with a peaceful human race.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:25.600
Let all those who know only war kill each other and die.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:39.800
Right... Message to all turrets.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:43.000
Do not fire upon the enemy flagship, Shubaten!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.060
Prioritize it!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:47.460
Admiral, why? We just closed range with them!

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:50.360
No. Have you overlooked...

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:55.430
...the reason why Üso's V2 went ahead of our ship?

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.200
People related by blood often...

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:02.660
...over or underestimate the abilities of their relatives.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:07.660
But I merely followed because it was what I felt I had to do.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:11.330
And I feel that Üso is acting for the same reasons.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.560
I see.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:16.330
This is the airspace where Angel Halo was activated.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:20.900
Is something here working to sharpen peoples' intuition?

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.560
Dad came, and now they're fighting a fleet battle!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.930
The White Ark has rendezvoused with the Reineforce Junior?

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.630
The White Ark has finally returned.

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.700
All hands, safe and sound.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.200
How's Karl doing?

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:46.500
Even with all that junk strapped to it, the V1's okay, too!

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.160
Even junk can be used as a barrier!

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.330
Can we be rearmed, please, Captain?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:55.300
Roger, but maintain 360 degree surveillance.

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.300
How's Karl doing?

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.230
Nothing unusual, at the moment.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:08.130
Another one?!

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:17.260
That's what you get for appearing in front of me!

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:26.100
I don't consider you an enemy.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:29.800
Our real enemy is Kagatie in Angel Halo.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.400
Smash the Federation and the League Militaire!

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:36.800
You boys whose souls are sensitive,

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.130
the enemy who must be defeated is here with me!

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.700
We'll handle the rearguard!

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.900
Leave the mobile suits to us! Üso, get to the Shubaten!

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:57.000
Tomáš! Odelo! I've got the Shubaten!

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:58.000
Go!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:07.400
Everywhere I go, the white one appears before me!

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.700
Our antiaircraft fire is too light! Don't let him near us!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:21.260
What's wrong with you, Fuala?! The white one's coming!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:24.900
The living shouldn't beg help from the dead!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:28.200
There's no way Guillotine Fuala could be dead.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:30.230
Why can't we shoot him down? Here he comes!

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:31.030
The white one!

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.030
It's here!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:35.000
The queen! Please hand over Queen Maria!

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.760
Don't leave your stations!

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.930
Desertion in the face of the enemy is a serious crime!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.560
Please release the queen and leave the bridge!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.530
Or else I'll smash it!

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:47.760
What can you do while I have the queen?

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.160
You coward!

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.160
Üso, never mind me!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.400
Kill me with him!

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.860
You were right to come here!

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.100
Quiet!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:07:01.200
Because of the woman I am, Kagatie built Angel Halo,

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:05.430
which drew in men like Tassilo who would take advantage of it!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:09.260
I'm the cause of all this misfortune, dear Üso!

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:10.630
Kill me!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.530
You're wrong!

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.630
There may be other people who could stand in your place,

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:19.000
but you're still the only mother Shahkti has!

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:20.360
I won't kill you!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.700
That's right.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.160
Even a woman who was Kagatie's puppet...

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:26.500
...can still drive that white monster away!

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:27.860
You're disgusting!

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:30.460
Kill Tassilo and me!

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.730
What?! What just happened?

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.930
What is it? Is something wrong with the princess?

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:50.060
We're getting external interference.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.030
You mean her senses are being overwhelmed?

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:54.000
I believe so.

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:05.330
That's what she gets for resisting me!

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.100
You're still too weak!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.260
How could he? How could...

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.330
What was that?

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.660
You're telling me to burn your body?

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.630
I see. Burn it with fire...

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:49.930
To purify it.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.330
It's better to be cleansed.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:04.760
Shahkti, I'm sorry.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.730
I'm going to do as your mother asked.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:20.130
This battle, this war...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.260
It's pushing people to the breaking point.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:25.630
O chosen ones, deepen your prayers.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.530
Let us soothe the violent hearts surrounding us.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.500
Pray, everyone.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.900
Pray silently, and it will become strength.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.400
Now to finish you!

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:49.500
Tassilo's Shubaten Fleet has been wiped out?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.830
You mean the queen has been killed in action, as well?

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:55.700
Admiral Sugan has ordered us to protect Angel Halo.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.100
Commandant!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.130
Where are you going?

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.660
The Rig Contio is ready, isn't it?

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:03.100
Even if you go clean up after Tassilo,

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:06.060
you mustn't tip your hand, Commandant!

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:07.360
You think so?

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:08.430
Yes, sir.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:12.130
No matter what, they'll be coming for Angel Halo.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.200
I see.

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:16.830
Angel Halo seems to be operating, thanks to Shahkti.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.700
We'll head for Angel Halo!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.830
That's right. I don't want to see you being careless.

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:24.760
I want you to show me your true strength!

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:31.360
Here, it tastes great.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.430
There's no way it'd be gross if you made it, Miss Elisha!

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.060
Tomáš, aren't you going to eat?

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.530
I just need a drink.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:38.460
Üso?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.100
I'm fine for now.

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:43.800
Eat some, even if you aren't hungry.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:44.830
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:46.930
Oh! Karl, no!

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.330
Karl, what's wrong?

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.630
Babies are amazing.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:55.430
He's gotten so good at space swimming.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:10:59.330
You want to go for a walk?

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.560
Karl, let's go outside!

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:08.060
Üso?

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.830
Is that so, Karl?

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.160
You're sure, huh?

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:19.600
What's going on, Üso?

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:24.300
Karl's telling me that Shahkti is in Angel Halo.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.900
The main enemy base?

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:28.430
Still, considering Karl's sensitivity...

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:33.130
Karl was really accurate hearing the bells, wasn't he?

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.260
And if you think about Shahkti's situation...

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:36.260
It's possible!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:37.860
Miss Marbet, do you hear me?

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.200
It's a message from the Reineforce.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:43.230
Everyone is to assemble aboard the Jeanne d'Arc, at once!

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:54.400
All pilots to the briefing room, on the double!

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:57.930
What's wrong?

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.730
It's all adults in there.

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.830
And everyone from the Shrike Team, too.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.700
Naturally. Now get in there with them!

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:07.230
We're not letting anyone else die, right?

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:08.460
In! In!

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:09.300
Right!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:35.900
You should all know by now that Angel Halo is an enormous brainwave transmitter,

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:40.330
but the problem is that it also has the power to directly affect cells...

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.660
...to produce a regression effect.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.260
What's that mean?

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:48.630
If you pick up Angel Halo's psycho waves, it turns you into an infant.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.330
Despite Üso eliminating the threat from Tassilo,

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:53.600
the target is still descending to Earth.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:58.330
The League Militaire Fleet, with Federation support,

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:00.960
will immediately launch an all-out attack on it.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.060
Admiral!

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:06.200
Most of the enemy's Mutterma Sugan Fleet is intact.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:09.360
And there are the remnants of the Motorad Fleet, as well!

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:14.530
Shouldn't we wait a little longer for the Federation Forces' assistance?

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.930
We can take Angel Halo with our current forces.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:21.230
Does the real Jinn Jahannam have any basis for saying that?

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.560
No, just a hunch.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.100
A... A hunch?

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:27.230
We've lost thousands of lives already!

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:27.660
Have you been fighting months and months, like we have?!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.600
You may have mobilized a Federation Forces fleet,

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:33.400
but can you still persuade these soldiers, Dad?

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:36.460
There's such a thing as luck in battles.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:39.530
And right now, the tide of battle is in our favor.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.030
Um, excuse me!

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.460
What do you want to say?

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:44.630
You have my permission to speak.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:46.060
Thank you, sir.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:50.730
I... My own weakness got Queen Maria killed.

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:53.100
She was precious to the enemy...

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:55.260
You're looking at it wrong, Üso.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:59.430
Thanks to your work, the League Militaire's morale is rising.

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:00.660
Yes, sir.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:04.330
All pilots' performance on every battle line has been exceptional.

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:05.730
Even in the rear...

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:08.800
There's no need to worry about the effects of Angel Halo's...

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:10.730
...psycho waves on the battlefield.

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:15.230
You can see here how the fleet facing the Reineforce Junior is deployed.

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:19.060
And don't let a bunch of amateurs show up pros like us, okay?!

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:21.900
Well then, I expect you all to work your hardest.

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:23.200
Dismissed!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:29.260
Your dad's a nice guy, isn't he?

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.760
He was praising you back there.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.160
You think?

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:37.230
Both the general and your dad read your combat report.

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:40.200
Did anybody reprimand you for it?

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.030
Right? So, cheer up.

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:46.600
Right. I'll head out, now.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:49.930
Dad!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.030
What?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:56.160
Um... Thank you very much!

00:14:56.760 --> 00:15:01.160
I couldn't have destroyed the Shubaten without the Jeanne d'Arc's help.

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:06.030
There were problems with how you did it, but you did the job in the end.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:07.100
Yes, sir!

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:09.930
I'm looking forward to seeing what else you can do.

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:11.730
Dad!

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:30.500
When did we get used to being soldiers?

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:34.960
Guess we've been stained by the war, huh?

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:36.560
Odelo!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:39.700
Air guns!

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:42.530
Use the air guns at full power and push them back!

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:43.760
Right!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:47.100
Odelo, what are you daydreaming about?!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.000
S-Sorry, Miss Juca!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.000
I'll go get the next load!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.000
Thanks!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.400
Thank you!

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:57.630
Hm, I'll get Üso to help, too.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:58.460
Don't!

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.500
Why not?

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:02.000
Looks like a lot happened aboard the Jeanne d'Arc.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.600
Marbet seems to be trying her best to comfort him,

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.860
but we can't do anything for him besides stand back and watch.

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:11.430
That's not true.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.600
Just letting him see a bright smile is plenty.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:18.160
It's like we're only here to be protected by the others.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:19.660
It's pathetic.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.330
What are you talking about?

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:24.900
Odelo only became a pilot because of you, Elisha.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.360
If you weren't here, we'd be in real trouble.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.730
For heaven's sake!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.500
Just for once, can't you sit still?

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.900
Even Üso's tired.

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.800
That should do it.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:43.400
Yeah.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:45.500
We're short on air tanks.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:46.930
Ask Warren.

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:48.260
Oh, right.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:53.300
Hey... Are men just tools for killing?

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:54.900
Why would you think that?

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:59.560
Because women make new life, while men...

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:03.630
They protect the environment that life grows in, right?

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.930
That's why they leave home to work.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:08.900
Does that apply to war, too?

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.960
Your dad seems like he's obsessed with war.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.160
So was my mom.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.260
But they gave birth to you, Üso.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.530
But I hate it.

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:23.300
Growing up where people are killing each other...

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:25.630
That's...

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:31.600
That's because your dad and mom raised you to be kind.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.630
That's why you feel that way.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.630
If that's true, it was cruel.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:41.460
In my case, it would have been easier if they'd raised me to be insensitive or war-crazy.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:47.400
Perhaps your parents' ideals are greater than you think,

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:49.830
and that's why they raised you this way.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:52.300
To show you how dangerous obsession is.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.400
But...

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:57.630
I don't want your baby to have to go through this too, Miss Marbet.

00:17:58.460 --> 00:17:59.930
I'll be careful.

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:08.000
Although I'm not keeping my hopes too high.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.800
Can you feel the baby yet?

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.200
Of course not.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.730
Although... Maybe you can feel it, Üso.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:16.630
Really?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:19.200
Try touching it.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:20.730
Oh, Karl!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.300
Oh! Karl, your hands are cold!

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.430
Karl?

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.200
Is it true?

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:29.800
You're having a baby?

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:32.630
Even I still don't know.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.800
Oh? Do you think so, Karl?

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.900
That's amazing!

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.260
Go on.

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.300
Excuse me.

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:57.700
Mr. Oliver's there. Inside this new life...

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:12.300
It's wonderful, isn't it, Miss Marbet?

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.860
Yeah, it is.

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:16.660
I think it's amazing, Üso.

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:29.400
So, the princess' prayer was disrupted...

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:32.530
...at the same moment Queen Maria was killed?

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.030
Do we continue?

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.100
Of course.

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:38.630
Actually, it's working better now than it was with Queen Maria.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:39.360
Yes, sir.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:42.930
The princess' protective instincts are working in a good direction.

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:48.360
All in all, they're aligning with the Earth's magnetic field,

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:52.430
spreading the effect of the psycho waves around the equator.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.160
Is that true, Otis?

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:59.560
Yes. They're low-power waves to start with, so they're easily affected by magnetic fields.

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:02.860
The Jeanne d'Arc is moving out. Please follow them.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.460
Roger! What about the White Ark?

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:08.360
They say they'll be a little late. They've got a game going.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.700
A game?!

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:13.760
Business must be good if they can play games before the final battle!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.330
That wannabe Jinn Jahannam!

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:18.600
Nice pass. Catch!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.300
All right!

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:21.460
Whoops!

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:23.030
You won't get past me!

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.800
Here! Pass it here!

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.960
Pass it to me and I'll get it in!

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:28.560
Got it!

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:31.330
The kids aren't bad.

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.100
Right before the final battle?

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:34.330
Something wrong with it?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:39.830
It's fine, Juca. Fighting isn't everything for us.

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:41.300
I guess.

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:44.400
We need to remember the things that make us happy.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.900
Otherwise, we'll forget what we're fighting for.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.100
I haven't been happy since I joined the military.

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:55.160
Live, and you can do what makes you happy.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:21:00.900
But unless we do our best, we might not be able to.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.800
Go on! Suzy, go after it!

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:10.660
The League Militaire Fleet is on the move?

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:11.300
Yes, sir.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:12.300
That was fast.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:15.630
But the Sugan Fleet isn't moving out.

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:19.330
Sugan thinks he's using me, but he's wrong.

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:23.500
When we smash the League Militaire, the Federation will crumble.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:28.960
And then I'll use Angel Halo against those who started this war.

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:32.630
You'll turn its power against Kagatie and Sugan?

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:36.030
I'll wave the white one's head in front of Kagatie to lure him,

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:38.900
then draw him into Angel Halo's waves.

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:43.530
And then I'll turn them into a couple of decrepit infants!

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:49.630
Üso Ewin, Victory 2! Here I go!

00:21:57.060 --> 00:22:00.560
For the sake of the women who carry the next generation, huh?

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:31.830
To save me,

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:35.430
Üso and the Shrike Team infiltrate Angel Halo.

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:38.230
In the face of the wings of light,

00:23:38.260 --> 00:23:40.730
Katejina challenges them with an assault weapon...

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:43.200
...in the form of lady warriors who fling themselves at the enemy.

00:23:44.030 --> 00:23:49.200
Üso comes to know the terror of human forms closing in on his mobile suit.

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:53.230
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.360 --> 00:23:53.500
"Atop the Angel's Halo".

00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:56.660
Next Episode ATOP THE ANGEL'S HALO
"Atop the Angel's Halo".

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:58.000
Please watch it!
